cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the data descriptor below."
title: "PERCIVAL: RNA-seq analysis code for the tomato leaf and rhizosphere multi-omics dataset"
abstract: >-
  Scripts and commands for the RNA-seq bioinformatic analyses and figure
  generation of the Scientific Data descriptor "Multi-omics analyses of tomato
  rhizosphere and leaves treated with a biowaste-derived biostimulant extract":
  preprocessing and alignment, technical validation QC, and quantification of
  the relative contributions of experimental trial, time point and treatment to
  transcriptome variance. Metabarcoding code is deposited separately.
type: software
license: MIT
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - biostimulant
  - humic substances
  - Solanum lycopersicum
  - batch effect
repository-code: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.0000000"   # replace with the minted DOI
authors:
